    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779010/extras/8465c0394a263ade508ae8a28d5eebcc.poster.avif?t=1734022845\" width=800 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779010/extras/8465c0394a263ade508ae8a28d5eebcc.webm?t=1734022845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779010/extras/8465c0394a263ade508ae8a28d5eebcc.mp4?t=1734022845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>War Job is a silly team fighting game using silly weapons, Doctors using needles, chefs using pans, artists using pencils and more than 26 other professions with different crazy weapons.<br>The game has more than 26 different characters representing many different professions for you to choose from. Each character has different quirky attacks that create CRAZY, funny and dramatic battles.<br>To win, you need to be agile, build the right strategy and coordinate well with your teammates<br>*** Outstanding features ***<br>- Tactical PVP<br>- Fighting characters with different strengths and unique attack skills<br>- Many maps to fight, lively and fun sounds<br>- Characters with balanced strength<br>- Fight online with friends<br>- Play alone or team up with 2 to 10 players together<br><br><strong>- Different professions have their own silly weapons and weird skills</strong><br>+ Farmers unleash pigs and cows<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779010/extras/1066e8a8c92f426eb81d3bf14ef4035c.poster.avif?t=1734022845\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779010/extras/1066e8a8c92f426eb81d3bf14ef4035c.webm?t=1734022845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779010/extras/1066e8a8c92f426eb81d3bf14ef4035c.mp4?t=1734022845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>+ Office workers attack with laptops and chairs<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779010/extras/388e7334f2a0dfd0640d68a23d47b0ac.poster.avif?t=1734022845\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779010/extras/388e7334f2a0dfd0640d68a23d47b0ac.webm?t=1734022845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779010/extras/388e7334f2a0dfd0640d68a23d47b0ac.mp4?t=1734022845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>+ Workers push wheelbarrows to shoot nails<br>+ Chefs use frying pans and can cook<br>+ Artists throw pencils<br>+ Policemen lock opponents in jail and shoot guns<br>+ Doctors throw needles and can heal teammates<br>+ Bank robbers throw bags of money at faces<br>+ Fighters with fists<br>+ Firefighters spray water<br>+ Scientists spread poison and coronavirus<br>+ Cleaners throw shit<br>+ Gardeners fly and throw bombs<br>+ Soldiers carry suicide grenades<br>+ Singers attack with voice and sound<br>+ Clown attack with balloons<br>+ Karate fighters with hand strikes<br>+ Runners dash and throw shoes<br>+ Farmer unleashes herd of pets<br>+ Musicians attack with trumpets<br>+ Bandleaders attack with sound systems<br>+ Tiktoker dancing and liking<br>+ Housewife with vacuum cleaner and everything in the kitchen<br>+ President escorted by tanks and planes",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779010/extras/8465c0394a263ade508ae8a28d5eebcc.poster.avif?t=1734022845\" width=800 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779010/extras/8465c0394a263ade508ae8a28d5eebcc.webm?t=1734022845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779010/extras/8465c0394a263ade508ae8a28d5eebcc.mp4?t=1734022845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>War Job is a silly team fighting game using silly weapons, Doctors using needles, chefs using pans, artists using pencils and more than 26 other professions with different crazy weapons.<br>The game has more than 26 different characters representing many different professions for you to choose from. Each character has different quirky attacks that create CRAZY, funny and dramatic battles.<br>To win, you need to be agile, build the right strategy and coordinate well with your teammates<br>*** Outstanding features ***<br>- Tactical PVP<br>- Fighting characters with different strengths and unique attack skills<br>- Many maps to fight, lively and fun sounds<br>- Characters with balanced strength<br>- Fight online with friends<br>- Play alone or team up with 2 to 10 players together<br><br><strong>- Different professions have their own silly weapons and weird skills</strong><br>+ Farmers unleash pigs and cows<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779010/extras/1066e8a8c92f426eb81d3bf14ef4035c.poster.avif?t=1734022845\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779010/extras/1066e8a8c92f426eb81d3bf14ef4035c.webm?t=1734022845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779010/extras/1066e8a8c92f426eb81d3bf14ef4035c.mp4?t=1734022845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>+ Office workers attack with laptops and chairs<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779010/extras/388e7334f2a0dfd0640d68a23d47b0ac.poster.avif?t=1734022845\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779010/extras/388e7334f2a0dfd0640d68a23d47b0ac.webm?t=1734022845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779010/extras/388e7334f2a0dfd0640d68a23d47b0ac.mp4?t=1734022845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>+ Workers push wheelbarrows to shoot nails<br>+ Chefs use frying pans and can cook<br>+ Artists throw pencils<br>+ Policemen lock opponents in jail and shoot guns<br>+ Doctors throw needles and can heal teammates<br>+ Bank robbers throw bags of money at faces<br>+ Fighters with fists<br>+ Firefighters spray water<br>+ Scientists spread poison and coronavirus<br>+ Cleaners throw shit<br>+ Gardeners fly and throw bombs<br>+ Soldiers carry suicide grenades<br>+ Singers attack with voice and sound<br>+ Clown attack with balloons<br>+ Karate fighters with hand strikes<br>+ Runners dash and throw shoes<br>+ Farmer unleashes herd of pets<br>+ Musicians attack with trumpets<br>+ Bandleaders attack with sound systems<br>+ Tiktoker dancing and liking<br>+ Housewife with vacuum cleaner and everything in the kitchen<br>+ President escorted by tanks and planes",
